Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.52,0:00:13.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The military swarmed into this city, which had lost its priest and had fallen into disorder,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:16.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and attacked the citizens here,\Ntrying to gain control militarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:19.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were the one who created the opportunity for them to do that, were you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:29.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The people of Liore are ethnically very similar to Ishbal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.04,0:00:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The folks at Central
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:35.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,must not have thought of them as being the same kind of people as themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:36.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.13,0:00:40.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am going to complete\Nthe Philosopher's Stone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.18,0:00:44.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for the sake of all people\Nwho suffer under tyranny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.47,0:00:45.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:46.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.29,0:01:17.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This one is on a whole other level\Ncompared with the ones Tucker was creating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.34,0:01:21.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this the legacy of\Nthe 5th Laboratory?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.43,0:01:27.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of these things were known to you \Nand Colonel Archer, weren't they, Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:30.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you guys hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.18,0:01:31.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've had enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.10,0:01:32.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:34.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:39.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major Armstrong doesn't have anything to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:42.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm{\i0} the one who was\Nharboring Martel-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about,\NAlphonse-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.78,0:01:46.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is something that\NI've come to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.33,0:01:49.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't say anything\Nabout it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.54,0:01:52.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but please, everyone,\Nno more fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.33,0:01:56.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:10.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major, I know that you're trying to carry on where Hughes left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.10,0:02:15.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"You can just make your way to the top without having to know about anything."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.69,0:02:18.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"I will investigate what's happening behind the scenes myself."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:20.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.99,0:02:25.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.45,0:02:27.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.21,0:02:36.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.29,0:02:37.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.54,0:02:39.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, listen to me, and tell Ed, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:41.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever, just get inside me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:46.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.09,0:02:48.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san, what on earth is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:50.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Liore is going to be\Nturned into another Ishbal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:51.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:54.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That man—the Führer—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.10,0:02:56.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is a homunculus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.79,0:04:42.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The military wants to\Nhave a just cause!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.79,0:04:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That cause being that ultimately, the town of Liore\Nwas the one who first attacked the military,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:49.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and thus they had no choice but to massacre us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:05:00.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lure the military in\Nwithout offering resistance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:02.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When that happens, the wrath of God\Nwill rain down upon them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:15.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's pretty bad taste to prop up\Na mute woman as a holy mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.28,0:05:19.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose-san is the one\Nwho gave us courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.62,0:05:21.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's the one who told us
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.67,0:05:25.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that we can stand under our own power, not by the god Leto, or the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.34,0:05:28.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all the same if it means you're still following somebody else, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.38,0:05:29.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:40.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We humans are so weak, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.23,0:05:48.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lyra, is that perfume?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.36,0:05:51.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't had\Na chance to bathe, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:05:57.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't like that smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:01.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind that,\Nwhat are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:03.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That should be obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:06.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think I can turn a blind eye to what Scar is doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.50,0:06:07.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:10.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, there are going to be casualties among the townspeople.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.59,0:06:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He says he's going to use the inbound military\Nas ingredients to transmute his Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.26,0:06:16.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if that fails...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.72,0:06:20.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And here I thought that\Nmaybe you admired Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.06,0:06:24.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We both feel the same way about wanting to protect the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.31,0:06:29.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lyra, I need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:31.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, I need you to hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:44.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Alphonse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:49.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He came from Liore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.79,0:06:51.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He brought a letter\Naddressed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.01,0:06:52.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's from Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:54.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then he's safe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.63,0:06:55.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.59,0:06:57.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to Ed-kun's letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.30,0:07:00.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar has turned the whole town into a transmutation circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:03.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He also says that by no means are we to enter the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.06,0:07:06.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they're planning
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.35,0:07:09.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to lure the military in and use them as ingredients for the Philosopher's Stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.98,0:07:10.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.11,0:07:18.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The ingredients for a \NPhilosopher's Stone are live humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:22.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And a very large\Nnumber of them, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.41,0:07:28.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You don't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.79,0:07:31.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's the truth behind the 5th Laboratory, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.09,0:07:35.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then the higher-ups within the military were sanctioning human experimentation...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:39.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, you're heading to Liore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.51,0:07:41.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they're together,\Nyou should meet up with Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.76,0:07:42.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:43.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.93,0:07:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we leave them alone,\NLiore will surrender in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.69,0:07:50.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arresting Scar after that happens will be good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.73,0:07:51.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.19,0:07:55.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Ed-kun's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:57.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Major just returned it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.35,0:08:24.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You fools, who defy the military,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:25.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,away with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.19,0:08:31.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Animals that can talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.15,0:08:32.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must be confused!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.19,0:08:34.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chimeras.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.48,0:08:35.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's them, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:39.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's more, they said \Nthere was a man who could
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.99,0:08:39.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,suddenly create explosions with just his touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:41.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.87,0:08:42.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.70,0:08:47.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those guys are just a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:51.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The main enemy forces will\Ndefinitely be invading afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As planned, we will draw them into the city,\Nwithout offering any resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:57.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before that happens, you're going to escape through that passageway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:04.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am going to go dispose of the enemy, who has come here as a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.31,0:09:12.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have an obligation to\Nmake sure they get away safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.94,0:09:18.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:28.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Rose, Lyra.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:30.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're being a pretty\Ngood loser, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.12,0:09:34.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that letter has arrived, then the military won't be coming in for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:38.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Scar can't get the ingredients for his Philosopher's Stone,\Nthen nothing is going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:42.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:46.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is get you away to someplace\Nwhere the military can't reach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.47,0:09:50.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Liore is going to fall under military command.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.56,0:09:55.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you have to blame someone,\Nblame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.69,0:09:59.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't overturn\Nthe military's decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.93,0:10:25.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.05,0:10:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seven thousand troops total,\Nall gathered together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.26,0:10:32.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would be possible for us to crush Liore right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:34.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.77,0:10:39.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Table the attack for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.44,0:10:40.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:43.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to the letter that Colonel Mustang received,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.49,0:10:46.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the Fullmetal Alchemist appears to still be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.07,0:10:51.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Liore may be preparing for a dialogue between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.74,0:10:53.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no possibility of that now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:58.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, we cannot very well \Ninvade the city without just cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:01.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pride,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.84,0:11:04.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what do you mean,\Ndelaying the assault?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:06.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have some complaint, Lust?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.09,0:11:10.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar is lying in wait\Nfor the military to invade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:14.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He intends to use those lives to\Ntransmute the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.02,0:11:16.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So why don't you send\Nthe military in right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.19,0:11:18.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am under orders\Nfrom you-know-who.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.07,0:11:23.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I do not know\Nwhat is being considered,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:25.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but that person's word is absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.82,0:11:27.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:30.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.45,0:11:33.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Scar is going to create a Philosopher's Stone,\Nthen I am going to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.83,0:11:38.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't embrace any wasted feelings for Scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:43.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are allowed to live\Nbecause of that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do not forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.38,0:11:49.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which is precisely the reason\Nwhy we have been seeking the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.35,0:11:53.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am going to Liore once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.72,0:11:55.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get the military moving as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.44,0:11:59.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gluttony?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.94,0:12:02.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... you-know-who said...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:10.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is fleeing all you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.33,0:12:14.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Ishbalans, who had the\Nsame color of skin that you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:17.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,were a bit more\Nchallenging than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.25,0:12:23.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I was expecting too much from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:26.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all that we've done, I thought\Nthey would be fighting back by now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:28.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I guess we haven't killed enough of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.15,0:12:48.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, it {\i1}is{\i0} you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.15,0:12:50.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crimson Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.86,0:12:53.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:55.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.49,0:13:00.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That scar is one of \Nmy best works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.08,0:13:04.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with your right arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:08.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of all the State Alchemists\Nwhom I kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.51,0:13:10.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you will be the last!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:16.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.69,0:13:24.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:33.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That right arm... I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.82,0:13:35.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just like that one time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.53,0:13:37.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,when my red stone was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:43.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Feed me as many as you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will take that cursed red light...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.63,0:13:51.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and transmute it into a \NPhilosopher's Stone within me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.22,0:13:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to\Nleave the city?\NLet's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.56,0:14:02.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! This is the will\Nof the Holy Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.15,0:14:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose, what will you do if Scar-san \Ndoes not come, even after we've fled?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.11,0:14:11.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Without the Philosopher's Stone,\Nwe cannot fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:12.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, Lyra.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:14.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll negotiate with the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.49,0:14:15.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somehow or other...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:17.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't put any trust into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.78,0:14:20.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We all have to split up and run away in all directions right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:22.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then, make our appeals from cities all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.91,0:14:25.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell everyone\Nwhat happened in Liore,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.29,0:14:28.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what happened in Ishbal in the past, and of the tyranny of the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.79,0:14:30.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll just become another story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.55,0:14:34.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yet another city tried to create a Philosopher's Stone and was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:50.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose, Lyra, you guys\Nget out of here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.07,0:14:59.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:02.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the rest of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:07.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're... Sensei's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:09.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.42,0:15:15.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Call me Wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.94,0:15:30.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose! You idiot, stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:46.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.12,0:15:48.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:49.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.59,0:15:52.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.34,0:15:55.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just being used by Scar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.30,0:15:56.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to die for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.93,0:15:58.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.57,0:16:14.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you guys' weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.49,0:16:17.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.03,0:16:22.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you guys come in contact\Nwith the bones or other remains of\Nthe one whose human transmutation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:24.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was the subject of an attempt at reanimation,\Nyou become unable to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:28.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys are impostors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.79,0:16:31.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why you cower\Nwhen faced with the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.75,0:16:34.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case,\NI don't have a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:38.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was transmuted with the remains of my own body as ingredients, after I was stillborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.34,0:16:44.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My real body is\Nnowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.89,0:16:46.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if it were,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.22,0:16:48.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it would be your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.19,0:16:58.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.78,0:17:05.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go to where\Nall the others went!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:05.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.48,0:17:34.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure\Nyou want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.94,0:17:38.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While you're chasing me around,\Nthe military could be on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.07,0:17:42.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am going to at least avenge my brother\Nfor what you did to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:43.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What foolishness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.82,0:17:45.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a fight over vengeance?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.20,0:17:48.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what is in this for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.62,0:17:49.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:50.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:53.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You killed that many of the\NIshbalan people for nothing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To put it my own way,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:17:59.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if you alter a person just a little bit,\Nthey become nothing more than a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.76,0:18:02.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Humans aren't all that great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.43,0:18:05.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You, me—we're all just\Nmeaningless things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.76,0:18:10.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're all hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.73,0:18:12.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I might indeed be hollow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.32,0:18:25.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I am not meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.24,0:18:28.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I said, Alphonse Elric,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:31.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am a State Alchemist,\Njust like your brother is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're nothing more\Nthan a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.29,0:18:35.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar-san, please stop too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:37.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:39.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stand aside, Alphonse Elric!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:43.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There has been \Nenough bloodshed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.39,0:18:51.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't you put an end\Nto this now, Scar-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:09.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did it, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.95,0:19:12.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your arm has been\Nsuperbly transmuted!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.95,0:19:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you hear that?\NThe countdown to your death?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.46,0:19:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your arm is slowly combining with \Nthe oxygen in the air, and before long...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.89,0:19:30.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look closely, and see\Nwhether or not I am hollow...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.52,0:19:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is what a real person looks like!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.49,0:19:53.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.75,0:19:57.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.33,0:20:01.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will do what you two could not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:16.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are red stones\Ndoing in his silver watch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.89,0:20:18.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made a promise, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:21.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That I was going to\Nblow you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.23,0:20:26.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alphonse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.69,0:20:28.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, you feel so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.20,0:20:32.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should make for...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:34.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a magnificent bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.83,0:20:43.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... You're the Führer's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.79,0:20:44.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.13,0:20:49.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you make me right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.31,0:21:01.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E...d...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.74,0:21:17.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me back my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:19.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:27.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.59,0:21:28.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:30.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make that thing shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.93,0:21:35.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up... Shut up...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:45.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get up... and walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:48.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.69,0:21:50.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Move... forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.45,0:21:53.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.62,0:21:57.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.34,0:23:39.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.05,0:23:43.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 42: "His Name Is Unknown"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.52,0:23:46.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.02,0:23:50.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this a Philosopher's Stone?
